00:19:51.359 --> 00:19:53.599
But he says that he is preferred before me.

00:19:53.599 --> 00:19:54.440
Why?

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:57.159
For he was before me because he is, he was,

00:19:57.159 --> 00:19:58.200
and he is to come.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:00.159
He is alpha and omega.

00:20:00.159 --> 00:20:02.919
that He has no beginning and no ending.

00:20:02.919 --> 00:20:05.319
Yes, there was a moment in history

00:20:05.319 --> 00:20:08.639
when the Word became flesh and the incarnation

00:20:08.639 --> 00:20:11.279
and what miracle that is.

00:20:11.279 --> 00:20:13.759
But John the Baptist understood,

00:20:13.759 --> 00:20:16.599
it says, and of His fullness have all we received

00:20:16.599 --> 00:20:20.159
and grace for grace for the law was given by Moses,

00:20:20.159 --> 00:20:24.119
but grace and truth come by Jesus Christ.

00:20:24.119 --> 00:20:27.079
No man hath seen God at any time,

00:20:27.079 --> 00:20:28.619
the only begotten Son,

00:20:28.619 --> 00:20:30.499
which is in the bosom of the Father,

00:20:30.499 --> 00:20:32.859
He hath declared Him.

00:20:32.859 --> 00:20:35.199
What great declaration that we read here

00:20:35.199 --> 00:20:36.939
in John chapter number one.

00:20:36.939 --> 00:20:38.899
And then I wanna fast forward to the third chapter.

00:20:38.899 --> 00:20:40.419
There's a few things that have happened

00:20:40.419 --> 00:20:43.299
between chapter one and chapter number three.

00:20:43.299 --> 00:20:45.499
Notably in John chapter number three,

00:20:45.499 --> 00:20:49.819
