00:20:51.899 --> 00:20:55.579
of course, Jesus says, marvel not that I said unto thee,

00:20:55.579 --> 00:20:57.419
ye must be born again.

00:20:57.419 --> 00:21:00.059
One of the most familiar verses of all the Bible

00:21:00.059 --> 00:21:03.299
is found in verse 16, for God so loved the world

00:21:03.299 --> 00:21:04.899
that He gave His only begotten Son

00:21:04.899 --> 00:21:07.679
that whosoever believeth in Him should not perish,

00:21:07.679 --> 00:21:09.419
but have everlasting life.

00:21:09.419 --> 00:21:12.459
And we find that after Jesus has this interaction

00:21:12.459 --> 00:21:15.179
with Nicodemus and makes these declarations,

00:21:15.179 --> 00:21:17.099
that you read in verse 22 that the Bible says,

00:21:17.099 --> 00:21:21.179
after these things came Jesus and His disciples

00:21:21.179 --> 00:21:22.939
into the land of Judea,

00:21:22.939 --> 00:21:26.619
and there He tarried with them and baptized.

00:21:26.619 --> 00:21:28.019
The Bible says in verse 23,

00:21:28.019 --> 00:21:31.259
and John also was baptizing in Anon near to Salem

00:21:31.259 --> 00:21:33.419
because there was much water there,

00:21:33.419 --> 00:21:35.299
and they came and were baptized,

00:21:35.299 --> 00:21:38.379
for John was not yet cast into prison.

00:21:38.379 --> 00:21:41.079
And so you kinda see the scene being set

00:21:41.079 --> 00:21:44.239
where Jesus is coming and John the Baptist is already there.

00:21:44.239 --> 00:21:48.559
Now, John the Baptist had had a huge following of people.

00:21:48.559 --> 00:21:50.899
As he went out into the wilderness and he proclaimed,

00:21:50.899 --> 00:21:53.379
and he was that forerunner for the Lord Jesus Christ,

00:21:53.379 --> 00:21:56.699
and he filled his role to do what Christ,

00:21:56.699 --> 00:21:58.339
what the Lord had commanded him to do,

00:21:58.339 --> 00:22:00.179
to be that forerunner of Christ.

00:22:00.179 --> 00:22:03.219
And the Bible sets the scene here that they're in Judea.

00:22:03.219 --> 00:22:06.059
Notice in verse 24, verse 25, excuse me,

00:22:06.059 --> 00:22:09.579
then there arose a question between some of John's disciples

00:22:09.579 --> 00:22:12.579
and the Jews about purifying.

00:22:12.579 --> 00:22:14.539
And they came unto John and said unto him,

00:22:14.539 --> 00:22:17.619
Rabbi, he that was with thee beyond Jordan,

00:22:17.619 --> 00:22:21.459
to whom thou barest witness, behold, the same baptizeth,

00:22:21.459 --> 00:22:24.499
and all men come to him.

00:22:24.499 --> 00:22:26.779
It's very interesting as you read the Bible

00:22:26.779 --> 00:22:29.659
that God gives us some really unique truth.

00:22:29.659 --> 00:22:31.779
And sometimes we can just skip right over it

00:22:31.779 --> 00:22:33.179
and just keep on going.

00:22:33.179 --> 00:22:35.539
But it says here in verse number 25,

00:22:35.539 --> 00:22:37.419
that there arose a question,

00:22:37.419 --> 00:22:39.299
and the question was about purifying,

00:22:39.299 --> 00:22:41.979
and it was between John's disciples and the Jews.

00:22:41.979 --> 00:22:43.699
But yet when they come to John,

00:22:43.699 --> 00:22:45.859
they don't even ask about the question.

00:22:45.859 --> 00:22:48.019
What they do is they say to John,

00:22:48.019 --> 00:22:51.419
hey, Jesus is over there and all men come to him.

00:22:52.899 --> 00:22:54.379
Right, do you see it?

00:22:54.379 --> 00:22:55.779
And notice what happens.

00:22:55.779 --> 00:22:58.339
John then answers in verse 27 and says,

00:22:58.339 --> 00:23:03.019
a man can receive nothing except to be given him from heaven.

00:23:03.019 --> 00:23:05.699
Ye yourselves bear me witness that I said,

00:23:05.699 --> 00:23:10.699
I am not the Christ, but that I am sent before him.

00:23:10.699 --> 00:23:14.459
For he that hath the bride is the bridegroom.

00:23:14.459 --> 00:23:16.659
But the friend of the bridegroom would standeth

00:23:16.659 --> 00:23:19.419
and heareth him, rejoiceth greatly

00:23:19.419 --> 00:23:21.119
because of the bridegroom's voice.

00:23:21.119 --> 00:23:25.379
This my joy therefore is fulfilled.

00:23:25.379 --> 00:23:26.299
What is John saying?

00:23:26.299 --> 00:23:27.939
As we look here in the text of scripture,

00:23:27.939 --> 00:23:29.699
John has a proper view,

00:23:29.699 --> 00:23:32.859
a proper understanding of who Jesus is.

00:23:32.859 --> 00:23:34.579
He's not gonna get sideways.

00:23:34.579 --> 00:23:35.799
He's not gonna get carnal.

00:23:35.799 --> 00:23:37.819
He's not gonna get filled with pride

00:23:37.819 --> 00:23:41.859
because these folks come to him in verse 26 and they say,

00:23:41.859 --> 00:23:45.819
hey, Jesus is over there and all men come to him.

00:23:45.819 --> 00:23:47.739
Hey, now there's more following him

00:23:47.739 --> 00:23:49.459
than there are following you.

00:23:49.459 --> 00:23:50.859
And you know what John says?

00:23:50.859 --> 00:23:52.579
Praise God.

00:23:52.579 --> 00:23:54.419
That's the purpose.

00:23:54.419 --> 00:23:56.459
It's not about me, it's about him.

00:23:56.459 --> 00:23:58.019
And that's why he would say in verse 30,

00:23:58.019 --> 00:24:01.259
he must increase, but I must decrease.

00:24:02.519 --> 00:24:06.219
And see, Isaiah got a proper view of God.

00:24:06.219 --> 00:24:10.099
John understood and had a proper view of God.

00:24:10.099 --> 00:24:12.939
In John 15 and Jesus is speaking.

00:24:12.939 --> 00:24:15.779
And it's important as we look at the text of scripture

00:24:16.619 --> 00:24:19.539
that we notice really a truth that God gives us.

00:24:19.539 --> 00:24:22.279
And again, it's a passage that we're familiar with,

00:24:22.279 --> 00:24:25.419
but I want you to just take note of a simple truth

00:24:25.419 --> 00:24:28.779
and we'll move on and then return to this passage

00:24:28.779 --> 00:24:30.139
in just a few moments.

00:24:30.139 --> 00:24:32.779
But I want you to see this proper view of God.

00:24:32.779 --> 00:24:36.579
Notice what Jesus says in verse number one of John 15.

00:24:36.579 --> 00:24:40.559
I am the true vine.

00:24:40.559 --> 00:24:42.139
Later throughout the passage,

00:24:42.139 --> 00:24:45.379
he will make reference again that he is the vine.

00:24:45.379 --> 00:24:48.799
And yet he says, ye are the branches.

00:24:48.799 --> 00:24:49.939
Can I tell you this morning,

00:24:49.939 --> 00:24:54.079
it's imperative that the branch recognizes the vine.

00:24:54.079 --> 00:24:54.919
Amen.

00:24:54.919 --> 00:24:58.419
It's imperative this morning that we have a proper view

00:24:58.419 --> 00:25:01.779
of who God is, that he is the vine,

00:25:01.779 --> 00:25:05.179
that truly as we look in the passage without him,

00:25:05.179 --> 00:25:06.799
we can do nothing.

00:25:08.819 --> 00:25:13.819
We had a garden over the summer and it produced fruit.

00:25:13.939 --> 00:25:16.179
But then we took that garden out

00:25:16.179 --> 00:25:19.779
and we removed that garden.

00:25:19.779 --> 00:25:22.579
And you find that as you do that,

00:25:22.579 --> 00:25:25.099
you understand the vine and the fruit that would come.

00:25:25.099 --> 00:25:27.739
Holly had flowers and she would take

00:25:27.739 --> 00:25:29.819
and occasionally she would take those flowers

00:25:29.819 --> 00:25:33.259
and she would cut them from the plants in the backyard

00:25:33.259 --> 00:25:34.199
and she'd bring them in

00:25:34.199 --> 00:25:36.419
and they'd be beautiful for a few days.

00:25:37.459 --> 00:25:39.379
I mean, just beautiful.

00:25:39.379 --> 00:25:42.319
But then just a few days, they're not beautiful anymore.

00:25:42.319 --> 00:25:43.219
Why?

00:25:43.219 --> 00:25:44.419
Because they're severed,

00:25:44.419 --> 00:25:48.739
they're cut off from their source of life.

00:25:48.739 --> 00:25:53.739
The vine gives the branch what it needs to survive

00:25:54.179 --> 00:25:58.779
and to thrive and you cut that and there's no more life.

00:25:58.779 --> 00:26:01.659
Oh, for a couple of days, it can look good.

00:26:01.659 --> 00:26:04.459
But then before long, it begins to droop over

00:26:04.459 --> 00:26:07.119
and it begins to drop petals.

00:26:07.119 --> 00:26:09.899
We're familiar with it, we understand it.

00:26:09.899 --> 00:26:13.699
So this morning, how do I identify pride in my life?

00:26:13.699 --> 00:26:16.299
How do I root pride out of my life?

00:26:16.299 --> 00:26:18.739
It begins with a proper view of God.

00:26:18.739 --> 00:26:21.819
Humble yourselves in the sight of the Lord.

00:26:22.659 --> 00:26:24.899
But then we understand this, number two,

00:26:24.899 --> 00:26:27.939
we must have a proper view of self.

00:26:27.939 --> 00:26:29.579
We must, it's absolutely imperative

00:26:29.579 --> 00:26:32.279
that we have a proper view of self.

00:26:32.279 --> 00:26:35.199
Now let me say this, the two truths are hand in hand.

00:26:35.199 --> 00:26:38.099
I mean, they're just absolutely complimentary

00:26:38.099 --> 00:26:40.639
one to another with the message this morning.

00:26:40.639 --> 00:26:43.979
I cannot have a proper view of God

00:26:43.979 --> 00:26:46.979
