00:26:52.319 --> 00:26:54.639
They're complimentary one to the other.

00:26:54.639 --> 00:26:57.219
And we find here this morning that it was Isaiah

00:26:57.219 --> 00:27:00.019
that after he saw God, as we read in Isaiah six,

00:27:00.019 --> 00:27:05.019
one through four, he then said, woe is me.

00:27:05.139 --> 00:27:08.239
In verse number five of Isaiah chapter six,

00:27:08.239 --> 00:27:11.859
for I am undone because I'm a man of unclean lips.

